Description: portable libc code, clean exit and windowed option
 - use memfd_create(), write() and exit() from the C library instead of the
   raw x86 syscalls of sys.h, so the intro builds on every architecture;
 - stop at the end of the song from the main thread (SDL_Quit restores the
   desktop resolution) instead of exiting from the audio callback, and do
   not read one byte past the end of the song buffer;
 - check the program link status and print the log on stderr (it was
   written on stdin and any warning stopped the intro);
 - add -w/--window to run the 640x360 windowed variant (upstream
   scalemark_small) from the same binary;
 - check SDL errors, free the libspectre document, rename abs() to avoid
   the conflict with stdlib.h, drop unused GLU/GLX includes.
